==French==

===Etymology===
* From Latin ''[[promittere]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-promettre.ogg|audio}}
* {{IPA|/pʁɔ.mɛtʁ/|lang=fr}}, {{SAMPA|/pRO.mEtR/}}

===Verb===
'''promettre'''

# to [[promise]]
#: ''Je te '''promets''' que je te rendrai ton argent avant dimanche.'' (I promise I'll give you your money back before Sunday.)
# {{context|intransitive}} to be [[promising]], to be [[hopeful]].
#: ''C'est une athlète qui '''promet'''.'' (She is a promising athlete.)

====Conjugation====
{{fr-conj-mettre|pro}}

====Derived terms====
* nouns: [[promesse]], [[prometteur]]

====Related terms====
* [[mettre]]

